\f0\fs24 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Yes. I think the relocation should arise from 
\f1\b \strokec2 quake-trance becoming commercially successful enough to offend its own believers
\f0\b0 \strokec2 .\
Here is the complete consolidated observation, including every comic/technical point we have established so far and the new Goa layer.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The cult is the Order of the Perpetual Drop.
\f0\b0  Its sacred music is 
\f1\b quake-trance
\f0\b0 . Quake-trance is designed to help the surrounding environment resonate with the call to the gods. The spinning stasis discs produce deep sub-frequencies; the musicians build the audible music around them; successful worship progressively recruits the floor, rock, buildings and landscape into the performance.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The principal gods are Ludwig, Zildjian and Rickenbacker.
\f0\b0  Their mythology can loosely associate Ludwig with thunder, Zildjian with the crashing heavens, and Rickenbacker with the vibration beneath the world. 
\f1\b Pearl, Gibson and H\'f6fner
\f0\b0  survive as minor gods, considered 
\f2\i so last Hootenanny
\f0\i0  by serious modern devotees.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Order originally flourished in 
\f1\b dry American desert canyons
\f0\b0 . Canyons were considered exceptionally holy acoustic spaces because the ground, canyon walls and exposed rock visibly and physically responded to the sub-frequencies emitted by the spinning discs. A successful Drop could make kilometres of landscape hum.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The American quake-trance scene eventually became 
\f1\b commercially intolerable
\f0\b0 . Resorts began selling \'93Authentic Perpetual Drop Experiences\'94; wellness chains installed decorative non-functional stasis discs; canyon landlords started charging resonance premiums; tourists arrived wearing reproduction vestments and asking what time the earthquake started. The Order declared the American desert 
\f1\b spiritually overdeveloped
\f0\b0  and went looking for somewhere the gods had not yet been franchised.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 They found a 
\f1\b bankrupt trance ashram in Goa
\f0\b0 , available cheaply after its previous proprietors failed to monetise enlightenment. The Order bought it largely because it contained a large performance chamber, permissive neighbours, sea views and enough electrical infrastructure to commit theological negligence on an industrial scale.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Goa initially looked like an acoustically perverse choice. Quake-trance tradition favoured dry rock. Goa offered monsoon water, humid air, lateritic ground, estuaries and the Arabian Sea. The Order consequently advertised its move as the beginning of 
\f1\b Wet Quake-Trance
\f0\b0 , which older devotees considered heresy until tickets sold out.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The ecology produced an unexpectedly profound resonant experience. Saturated laterite, groundwater, estuarine mud and tidal water behaved less like the hard sounding-board of a desert canyon and more like an enormous 
\f1\b coupled membrane
\f0\b0 . Dry canyon worship produced sharp, local geological response. Goa produced slower, deeper vibrations that travelled away into the landscape and returned in places nobody had invited them from.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The congregation loved this. During major services the floor moved gently, coconut palms shivered without wind, standing water developed concentric ripples, and the estuary occasionally displayed waves travelling in directions unavailable to ordinary water. These were treated as increasingly sophisticated replies from Ludwig, Zildjian and Rickenbacker.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	9	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 This makes Goa vastly more dangerous than the American canyons. The waterlogged substrate and connection to the sea provide a much larger low-frequency resonant system. The discs can entrain geology far beyond the temple itself. Instead of producing a spectacular local vibration, a particularly coherent Drop can establish 
\f1\b remote resonance loci
\f0\b0  thousands of kilometres away.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	10	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The disastrous service uses multiple industrial stasis discs as part of the quake-trance rig. Their ordered resonance reaches extraordinary coherence. The congregation experiences one of the finest services in Order history. 
\f1\b Goa gets a memorable evening. Rotherhithe gets demolished.
\f0\b0 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	11	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Rotherhithe is the anomaly.
\f0\b0  There is no Gyges or stasis facility anywhere near it. A London district simply begins undergoing effects consistent with a catastrophic stasis resonance event while the originating equipment is thousands of kilometres away in Goa.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	12	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Thames should participate. My preferred version is that the resonance establishes a standing wave in the tidal river. For several minutes 
\f1\b the Thames develops a hump at Rotherhithe
\f0\b0 : water piles itself above its normal level without going anywhere, leaving boats sitting at absurd angles on either side of it. When the field collapses, the hump lets go and deposits at least one river vessel somewhere administratively impossible\'97perhaps 
\f1\b a Thames sightseeing boat on the roof of a riverside car park
\f0\b0 , where the operator continues the recorded commentary because the ticket terms contain no provision for geological ascension.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	13	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Another useful Thames detail: tide gauges briefly report 
\f1\b two high tides occupying the same stretch of river at once
\f0\b0 . The Port Authority initially rejects the readings because its software permits only one Thames. This feels particularly suited to the later Fridge Force report.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	14	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Fridge Force initially sees no reason to connect Rotherhithe with a religious dance event in Goa. International partners eventually correlate the timing, surviving stasis telemetry and field signatures. The investigation takes roughly a year because the proposition they are trying to prove is inherently ridiculous: 
\f1\b people spinning stasis discs to summon Rickenbacker in Goa destroyed part of London.
\f0\b0 \
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	15	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The decisive technical conclusion is that sufficiently coherent stasis resonance can produce a strong 
\f1\b non-local physical effect
\f0\b0 . The strongest effect can appear thousands of kilometres from the generating equipment. Rotherhithe becomes Fridge Force shorthand for that entire class of hazard.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	16	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The detailed Rotherhithe investigation is 
\f1\b classified
\f0\b0 . Chip\'92s brief warning to Sarah and Hayley should remain brief. When Hayley later decides she needs the full report, she has to persuade Chip to give her illicit access to a Fridge Force archive.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	17	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Chip has excellent reasons to hesitate. Fridge Force has already sentenced him in absentia to approximately 
\f1\b 300 years inside a freezer inside a stasis prison
\f0\b0 . Granting Hayley classified access adds further offences to a sentence whose practical meaning has already become largely decorative.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	18	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The classified report contains the glorious cultural details: 
\f1\b Order of the Perpetual Drop; quake-trance; Ludwig, Zildjian and Rickenbacker; Pearl, Gibson and H\'f6fner; \'93so last Hootenanny\'94; the failed monetisation of enlightenment; Wet Quake-Trance; the theological interpretation of geological movement.
\f0\b0  Fridge Force presents all of this with mortifying bureaucratic seriousness.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	19	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Hayley encounters 
\f1\b Hootenanny
\f0\b0  in the report and looks it up without success. Most Americana disappeared when every data centre in the Lower States boiled itself to sludge during the 
\f1\b Great Silicon Meltdown of the mid-21st century
\f0\b0 . The culture vanished. Financial records had naturally been replicated elsewhere.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	20	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The five-disc Kebab danger scales beyond the simple two-disc case. In the story\'92s technical logic, five coherent discs create 
\f1\b 5 \'d7 4 \'d7 3 \'d7 2 = 120 ordered relationships/permutations
\f0\b0  contributing to the combined resonance state. That allows enormously richer field geometry than the two-disc experiments Chip has reluctantly tolerated.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	21	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Rotherhithe proves remote manifestation.
\f0\b0  Later Shakti research asks whether changing the ordered phase relationships can alter the position, shape or strength of the remote locus. That is the point at which Fridge Force begins seeing plausible military applications.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	22	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Project Kebab later reproduces the principle accidentally.
\f0\b0  The increasingly coherent five-disc state produces a distant event in the Gibson Desert. The event\'92s location corresponds to the resonance geometry even though nobody consciously selected Gibson as a target.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	23	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Sarah\'92s dreams potentially carry the missing control information.
\f0\b0  The patterns become increasingly coherent as Kebab develops. They may genuinely constitute interdimensional communication while simultaneously encoding the ordered relationships through which five discs organise their combined field. Information and weaponisation therefore emerge from the same phenomenon.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	24	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The eventual frightening progression is:\uc0\u8232 
\f1\b quake-trance 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  remote Rotherhithe effect 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Fridge Force investigation 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Shakti research into movable loci 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  five-disc Kebab coherence 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Gibson event 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  recognition that coherent information may also configure the field.
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The Goa move now has a useful comic irony at its centre: 
\f1\b \strokec2 the Order leaves the desert because quake-trance has become commercialised and acoustically stale, discovers a wetter and supposedly more sophisticated form of worship, and accidentally discovers the planetary transmission characteristics required to flatten Rotherhithe.}